# Copy to .env.local and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored — never commit the key.
#
# Kakao Developers > 내 애플리케이션 > 앱 키 > JavaScript 키
# (REST API 키가 아닙니다.)
#
# The origin below must be registered at
# 앱 설정 > 플랫폼 > Web > 사이트 도메인:
#   http://localhost:5173
#
# Leave this unset and the app falls back to the built-in stand-in map, which
# still renders pins, routes and list selection.
VITE_KAKAO_MAP_KEY=
